# Child of the Volcano: "At the beginning of YOUR end step, if you descended this turn". Bot1 casts it on turn 1 with four Moxen
# (no descent, no counter). On turn 2 Bot2 kills Bot1's Ornithopter with Lightning Bolt: Bot1 descends (CR 700.11), but it is Bot2's
# turn and Bot1's Child has no end-step trigger now. "This turn" ends with turn 2, so on turn 3 Bot1's end step (no descent that turn)
# gives nothing either: the Child is still a 3/3.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Child of the Volcano
Ornithopter
Mountain
Plains x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x20

